  "title": "Louis Vuitton Petite Malle Capitale in Aged Gold",
  "original_title": "Louis Vuitton 仿旧金色 Petite Malle Capitale 小硬箱",
  "excerpt": "The Petite Malle Capitale trunk blends medieval armor inspiration with opulent details like an antiqued metallic finish, gold clasp, and black leather trim.",
  "author": "撰稿 X LING 编辑 X VIVI",
  "date_iso": "2026-11-04",
  "date_label": "November 04, 2026",
