    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Steeped in old-world allure, the Petite Malle Capitale trunk draws its inspiration from medieval battle armor. An antiqued metallic finish sets off the embossed Monogram motif, while a gold S-lock clasp, black leather trim, and metal corner guards complete the look—a nod to the opulence of the royal court.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
