    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bag is crafted from natural calfskin, its antiqued metallic finish lending a fine pearlescent sheen—like bronze armor weathered by time. The highlight is the allover embossed \"Monogram Epic\" pattern, which makes the house's signature motif appear as a three-dimensional relief across the body, creating a look full of tension.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
