    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Nicolas Ghesquière chose the brand's classic Petite Malle trunk to convey the hardness of armor—the Petite Malle was launched for LV's Fall/Winter 2014 season, with a sculptural, refined box shape inspired by the brand's 1929 photography trunk.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/crlarzq/c32b69c245c528c8.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/crlarzq/d2f85401df6376f3.jpg",
          "price": "LV 2014秋冬时装秀"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/crlarzq/44ef915e893c6125.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/crlarzq/d470fd675f5b654f.jpg",
          "price": "LV 1929年摄影箱"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Petite Malle's signature elements are taken to the extreme this season—most notably the antiqued gold S-lock clasp at the center, which echoes the gold leather body like an antique treasure chest; black calfskin trim gives the bag greater dimensionality and visual layering; and the iconic metal corner guards and rivets are the finishing touch, evoking the pauldrons and rivets of armor for a sense of traveling through time.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/crlarzq/384e9e71c6a7a42a.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/crlarzq/384e9e71c6a7a42a.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
