          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The closure is simple and can be operated with one hand. Just push the two round studs on the clasp toward the center, and with a crisp click, the triangular metal plate springs open; once open, you'll see leather gussets on both sides that unfold to about a 45° angle, making it easy to access the contents and preventing spills.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
