    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bag features a single, rounded yet rigid top handle wrapped in fine black calfskin, giving it a commanding presence in the hand.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/crlarzq/07f3a9a24659d87a.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/crlarzq/9d0eaff614db5d2d.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "It also comes with a detachable, adjustable slender calfskin strap for shoulder or crossbody wear, adding a casual, easygoing touch to this antique-like little trunk.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
