      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Open the bag to reveal a refined nude lambskin lining, accented with the classic LV Malletage diamond-quilted line print.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/crlarzq/d921879b0ac3d2f1.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/crlarzq/60cc96d71dcbc3d4.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Petite Malle is rigid and structured, so we don't recommend overstuffing it. We placed a phone, a notebook, a coin purse, and some small touch-up items inside—it holds more than you'd expect, easily handling important occasions or evening parties.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
