    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton is a globally renowned luggage and leather goods brand, founded by Louis Vuitton in Paris, France, in 1854. In 1987 it merged with French drinks company Moët Hennessy to form LVMH, the world's largest luxury group. In addition to trunks and handbags, it also operates in fashion, jewelry, eyewear, footwear, watches, and fragrance. since 1854 from Paris",
